@startuml Crystal_ERP_Backend
!theme plain
title Crystal — Backend : couches, auth et persistance

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

' Un seul type de diagramme (classes) + éléments mixtes autorisés
allowmixing

package "Crystal.API" as API {
  class Program <<entry>>
  class AuthController <<Controller>>
  class ProduitController <<Controller>>
  class ErrorHandlingMiddleware <<Middleware>>
}

package "Crystal.Core" as Core {
  interface IAuthService
  interface IProduitService
  class ApplicationUser <<Entity>>
  class Produit <<Entity>>
  together {
    class "DTOs\n(Login, Register…)" as DTOs
    class ApplicationRoles <<roles>>
  }
}

package "Crystal.Infrastructure" as Infra {
  class AppDbContext <<EFCore>>
  class AuthService <<service>>
  class ProduitService <<service>>
  package "Migrations" as Mig {
    class InitialCreate <<migration>>
    class AddAspNetIdentity <<migration>>
  }
}

class "IdentityDbContext (ApplicationUser)" as IdentityBase <<Identity>>

database "PostgreSQL" as PG

Program ..> AppDbContext : Configure +\nMigrate (dev)
Program ..> ApplicationRoles : seed rôles

AuthController --> IAuthService
ProduitController --> IProduitService
ErrorHandlingMiddleware ..> Program : pipeline HTTP

IAuthService <|.. AuthService
IProduitService <|.. ProduitService

AuthService --> AppDbContext
ProduitService --> AppDbContext

AppDbContext --|> IdentityBase
AppDbContext --> ApplicationUser
AppDbContext --> Produit
AppDbContext ..> Mig : Migrate au\ndémarrage (dev)

AppDbContext --> PG : Npgsql

note right of PG
  Chaîne **DefaultConnection**
  (local ou **Host=db** sous Docker)
end note

note bottom of API
  **JWT** : authentification Bearer
  après **AddIdentity** + **UseAuthentication**
end note

@enduml
